      </div>

      <div class="facility-card makan-malam">
        <div class="facility-icon">🔥</div>
        <div>
          <span>MAKAN MALAM</span>
          <h3>BBQ</h3>
          <p>Menikmati suasana malam dengan BBQ bersama.</p>
